# never commit a real vault or a real config with live values
.secretgate/
vault.json

# The test corpus is generated by scripts/gen-corpus.ts, which is seeded and
# deterministic, so the JSON is a derived artifact rather than source. It is not
# committed for a practical reason: it contains ~200 realistically shaped fake
# credentials, and every push-protection scanner on earth correctly objects to
# them. The hand-written hard negatives — the half that determines precision —
# live in the generator itself, where they are just as reviewable.
#
#   npx tsx scripts/gen-corpus.ts
#
test/corpus/
